365 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 908 0 R
/E (Sweep or vacuum the tiles regularly to remove dust and debris. Clean them with a damp mop using a mild detergent or soap solution, adding 15-20 ml of coconut oil to help maintain their finish.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
366 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 909 0 R
/E (Avoid Harsh Chemicals: Avoid using acidic or abrasive cleaners, as they can damage the surface of the tiles. It is best to stick to pH-neutral cleaners for optimal results.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
367 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 910 0 R
/E (Wipe Up Spills: Promptly wipe up spills to prevent stains from setting in.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
