/K [14]
>>
endobj
372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (The standard size of Athangudi tiles is 10 inches x 10 inches x 19 mm, with borders or skirtings available in a size of 10 inches x 5 inches x 19 mm.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
